Package: pagewing
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libfontconfig1, libx11-6, libice6, libsm6, libssl3 | libssl3t64
Recommends: libcups2, xdg-utils
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/benjo-code/Pagewing
Description: Fast, offline PDF viewer
 Pagewing is a fast, open-source PDF viewer. It works offline and collects
 no telemetry; the only network access is an update check against the
 project's GitHub releases, which can be switched off in the settings.
 .
 The package also installs the pagewing command-line tool.
